From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Garvit Chhabra <garvit.chhabra@hotmail.com>
Date: Thu, 4 Sep 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Exclude Nix store from CMake runtime dependency resolution

On Nix-managed systems, CMake's GET_RUNTIME_DEPENDENCIES finds both
/lib64/ld-linux-x86-64.so.2 and /nix/store/.../ld-linux-x86-64.so.2,
causing a "Multiple conflicting paths" error during install.

---
 etc/packaging.cmake | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/etc/packaging.cmake b/etc/packaging.cmake
--- a/etc/packaging.cmake
+++ b/etc/packaging.cmake
@@ -49,6 +49,7 @@
   install(RUNTIME_DEPENDENCY_SET ${PROJECT_NAME}_dlls
     PRE_EXCLUDE_REGEXES "api-ms-" "ext-ms-"
     POST_EXCLUDE_REGEXES ".*system32/.*\\.dll"
+      "/nix/store/.*"
     DIRECTORIES ${DLL_SEARCH_DIRS}
     COMPONENT ${target}
     )
